            "review_title": "Review at Kichi Kichi",
            "review_text": "Anh Thư\n1 contribution\n0\nDelicious food\nMay 2020\nI went to Kichi Kichi with my mom last week. I always love that place. Kichi Kichi is near my grandparents’s house. The broth is delicious but the most I like is food, pieces of raw beef are not tough and fresh. Staffs are really nice and friendly, too. There is lots of seats, it’s not too cheap but it’s delicious. Maybe I will go there regularly.\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 27, 2020",
