            "review_title": "Review at Kichi Kichi",
            "review_text": "Aprille R\nLuzon, Philippines534 contributions\n0\nBest Value Shabu Shabu\nNov 2018 • Family\nFor Vietnam Dong 189,000, this eat all you can revolving shabu shabu bar is quite a steal! You get to choose a wide variety of pork, beef, seafood, vegetables, and noodles that you can dunk in to your own boiling pot. The mushroom broth where you dunk all these choices tasted so good too! Be prepared though to sweat it out as the restaurant’s airconditioning could not keep up with the heat of the boiling pots.\nRead more\nWritten November 9, 2018",
