            "review_text": "Anoek H\n75 contributions\n0\nGood food and good price\nDec 2016 • Friends\nGreat place to enjoy a dinner with your own hotpot. The food is good and you have also some choices from the buffet. You choose your hotpot flavor like spicy or medium spicy. Then you cook your own food by choosing what you want from the running diner. Nice staff and very helpful. \nIt was weird that we had to pay tip without asking if we want to pay that. Also paid for towels but they never asked if we wanted a towel. We didn't use it but had to pay for them.\nRead more\nWritten December 14, 2016",
