            "review_title": "Review at Kichi Kichi",
            "review_text": "Nhu_Phuong\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam292 contributions\n0\nA different experience\nMay 2016 • Friends\nThis is a nice place for people who want to enjoy their lunch/dinner by themselves. Every person gets a small hot pot for themselves with their preferred favors of broth and they can grab whatever they want coming out on the carousel. There's meat, eggs, mushrooms, vegetables and various types of noodles. \nI enjoyed the place very much regarding the eating experience but the food is quite average. \nI'd still give it a try for the experiences if I were near one.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 11, 2016",
